# Move Selection: translate and handle resizes, with and without Shift.
doc 150 110
noise 5 opaque
tool Lasso
down 20 20 L
move 70 15
move 80 60
move 50 75
move 25 55
up 25 55 L
tool Move Selection
drag L 40 40 55 48 3
dump moved
drag L 85 70 100 90 2
dump resize-se
drag L 50 50 30 30 2 S
dump resize-shift
undo
undo
dump undone
sel-ellipse 10 10 60 40
handle-radius 6
drag L 40 10 40 0 2
dump resize-n
drag L 10 30 0 30 2 S
dump resize-w-shift
